org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135958688,imgsize-335172.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['B team of SP, Congress': CM Yogi targets Owaisi-Chandrashekhar alliance ahead of UP polls]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/b-team-of-sp-congress-cm-yogi-targets-owaisi-chandrashekhar-alliance-ahead-of-up-polls/articleshow/135958128.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135958128.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a recent statement, Uttar Pradesh Chief Minister Yogi Adityanath condemned the collaboration between AIMIM leader Asaduddin Owaisi and Chandrashekhar Aazad, labeling it as a secondary faction for the Samajwadi Party and Congress. As both leaders gear up for the upcoming 2027 Assembly elections, they aim to challenge the BJP's grip on power.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/b-team-of-sp-congress-cm-yogi-targets-owaisi-chandrashekhar-alliance-ahead-of-up-polls/articleshow/135958128.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/b-team-of-sp-congress-cm-yogi-targets-owaisi-chandrashekhar-alliance-ahead-of-up-polls/articleshow/135958128.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T15:06:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135958180,imgsize-70830.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[NCBS researcher from Bengaluru wins Google PhD Fellowship]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ncbs-researcher-from-bengaluru-wins-google-phd-fellowship/articleshow/135957221.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135957221.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ncbs-researcher-from-bengaluru-wins-google-phd-fellowship/articleshow/135957221.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ncbs-researcher-from-bengaluru-wins-google-phd-fellowship/articleshow/135957221.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T14:42:18+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135957379,imgsize-57808.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Whitewashing history': Shiv Sena Shinde faction leaders tear up a copy of Sonia Gandhi's memoir]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/whitewashing-history-shiv-sena-shinde-faction-leaders-tear-up-a-copy-of-sonia-gandhis-memoir/articleshow/135956466.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135956466.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/whitewashing-history-shiv-sena-shinde-faction-leaders-tear-up-a-copy-of-sonia-gandhis-memoir/articleshow/135956466.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/whitewashing-history-shiv-sena-shinde-faction-leaders-tear-up-a-copy-of-sonia-gandhis-memoir/articleshow/135956466.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T14:39:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135957222,imgsize-1349395.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Lateef killed': Forces celebrate in Kulgam as Kashmir’s last known active local terrorist falls]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/lateef-killed-forces-celebrate-in-kulgam-as-kashmirs-last-known-active-local-terrorist-falls/articleshow/135957083.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135957083.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/lateef-killed-forces-celebrate-in-kulgam-as-kashmirs-last-known-active-local-terrorist-falls/articleshow/135957083.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/lateef-killed-forces-celebrate-in-kulgam-as-kashmirs-last-known-active-local-terrorist-falls/articleshow/135957083.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T14:39:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Subhadra Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135957819,imgsize-13580801.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Youth must know what UP was like 10 years ago': CM Yogi renews 'batenge toh katenge' pitch]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/youth-must-know-what-up-was-like-10-years-ago-cm-yogi-renews-batenge-toh-katenge-pitch/articleshow/135954292.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135954292.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Yogi Adityanath defended his slogans at the News18 Rising Bharat Summit, emphasizing awareness of Uttar Pradesh's historical issues. He highlighted past governance failures, including riots and insecurity, under the Samajwadi Party. Adityanath claimed the state is now safer and riot-free under BJP leadership. He reiterated that security, nationalism, and cultural nationalism would be central themes in upcoming elections.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/youth-must-know-what-up-was-like-10-years-ago-cm-yogi-renews-batenge-toh-katenge-pitch/articleshow/135954292.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/youth-must-know-what-up-was-like-10-years-ago-cm-yogi-renews-batenge-toh-katenge-pitch/articleshow/135954292.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T14:33:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135954972,imgsize-56186.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Saffron saree row: West Bengal government to probe claim Kolkata school questioned teacher's dress choice]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/saffron-saree-row-west-bengal-government-to-probe-claim-kolkata-school-questioned-teachers-dress-choice/articleshow/135956057.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135956057.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[West Bengal education minister Dipak Barman is set to investigate allegations regarding a teacher's attire at a missionary school. The charges claim a colleague questioned the teacher for wearing saffron sarees, alleging a dress code violation. Chief minister Suvendu Adhikari indicated potential actions against individuals or the institution if complaints are verified. BJP's Samik Bhattacharya also raised concerns about possible religious conversions at such institutions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/saffron-saree-row-west-bengal-government-to-probe-claim-kolkata-school-questioned-teachers-dress-choice/articleshow/135956057.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/saffron-saree-row-west-bengal-government-to-probe-claim-kolkata-school-questioned-teachers-dress-choice/articleshow/135956057.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T14:30:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135956464,imgsize-144126.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SC to hear PIL against Italian politician’s ‘Vote Chor’ remarks at Bharat Summit]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-to-hear-pil-against-italian-politicians-vote-chor-remarks-at-bharat-summit/articleshow/135956418.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135956418.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-to-hear-pil-against-italian-politicians-vote-chor-remarks-at-bharat-summit/articleshow/135956418.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-to-hear-pil-against-italian-politicians-vote-chor-remarks-at-bharat-summit/articleshow/135956418.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T14:29:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Subhadra Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135956961,imgsize-1149057.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[J&amp;K: Kulgam attack mastermind Lateef Bhat killed after week-long operation]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jk-kulgam-attack-mastermind-lateef-bhat-killed-after-week-long-operation/articleshow/135955789.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135955789.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In a significant operation, security forces eliminated Mohammad Lateef Bhat in Kulgam after a series of strategic maneuvers lasting a week. Earlier, his associate, Umar Nisar Dar, was taken down in a separate encounter. Lateef had wounded three CRPF personnel during a recent attack and had evaded capture since then. The authorities reiterated their strong stance against further terrorist activities in the region.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jk-kulgam-attack-mastermind-lateef-bhat-killed-after-week-long-operation/articleshow/135955789.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jk-kulgam-attack-mastermind-lateef-bhat-killed-after-week-long-operation/articleshow/135955789.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T13:58:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Bharti Jain</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135955943,imgsize-79710.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Plea alleges Sonia Gandhi used forged papers for 1980 voter entry; court seeks police report]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/plea-alleges-sonia-gandhi-used-forged-papers-for-1980-voter-entry-court-seeks-police-report/articleshow/135952197.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135952197.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Rouse Avenue Court has instructed the officer in charge of the IP Estate Police Station to prepare an Action Taken Report regarding a complaint that alleges Sonia Gandhi’s name was on electoral rolls before she was granted Indian citizenship. During proceedings, the advocate presented electoral roll records from 1980 to 1983.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/plea-alleges-sonia-gandhi-used-forged-papers-for-1980-voter-entry-court-seeks-police-report/articleshow/135952197.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/plea-alleges-sonia-gandhi-used-forged-papers-for-1980-voter-entry-court-seeks-police-report/articleshow/135952197.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T13:29:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135954463,imgsize-613621.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SCBA urges Supreme Court to initiate criminal contempt proceedings against advocate]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/scba-urges-supreme-court-to-initiate-criminal-contempt-proceedings-against-advocate/articleshow/135953098.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135953098.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/scba-urges-supreme-court-to-initiate-criminal-contempt-proceedings-against-advocate/articleshow/135953098.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/scba-urges-supreme-court-to-initiate-criminal-contempt-proceedings-against-advocate/articleshow/135953098.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T12:32:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Dhananjay Mahapatra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135953223,imgsize-1794616.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Heavens will not fall': SC on ED plea challenging Azam Khan's interim bail]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/heavens-will-not-fall-sc-refuses-to-stay-azam-khans-interim-bail/articleshow/135952394.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135952394.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/heavens-will-not-fall-sc-refuses-to-stay-azam-khans-interim-bail/articleshow/135952394.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/heavens-will-not-fall-sc-refuses-to-stay-azam-khans-interim-bail/articleshow/135952394.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T12:20:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135952628,imgsize-126522.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Unvaccinated yellow fever-risk travellers may face six-day quarantine; new airport rules propose changes]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/unvaccinated-yellow-fever-risk-travellers-may-face-six-day-quarantine-new-airport-rules-propose-changes/articleshow/135952010.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135952010.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[India has unveiled draft regulations enhancing quarantine protocols for travelers from yellow fever-affected nations. Unvaccinated arrivals could face quarantine of up to six days at their own expense. Airlines will be responsible for transporting non-compliant passengers to designated facilities. Furthermore, new reporting standards concerning passenger health and travel information will be established for airlines. The health ministry is collecting feedback from all stakeholders on these proposed measures before finalization.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/unvaccinated-yellow-fever-risk-travellers-may-face-six-day-quarantine-new-airport-rules-propose-changes/articleshow/135952010.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/unvaccinated-yellow-fever-risk-travellers-may-face-six-day-quarantine-new-airport-rules-propose-changes/articleshow/135952010.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T12:12:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135952471,imgsize-132943.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In just one week, how security forces avenged attack on CRPF personnel in Kulgam]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/in-just-one-week-how-security-forces-avenged-attack-on-crpf-personnel-in-kulgam/articleshow/135949647.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135949647.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/in-just-one-week-how-security-forces-avenged-attack-on-crpf-personnel-in-kulgam/articleshow/135949647.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/in-just-one-week-how-security-forces-avenged-attack-on-crpf-personnel-in-kulgam/articleshow/135949647.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T12:08:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Subhadra Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135952396,imgsize-178432.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[NMC asks medical colleges to vet draft rules seeking tighter checks on animal experiments]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-asks-medical-colleges-to-vet-draft-rules-seeking-tighter-checks-on-animal-experiments/articleshow/135952093.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135952093.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The National Medical Commission has introduced new draft rules to enhance the ethical treatment of laboratory animals in research. Emphasizing the importance of alternative methods, researchers must prioritize minimizing animal suffering and avoid experiments that could result in prolonged distress. Furthermore, institutions are mandated to appoint veterinarians and form ethics committees to supervise the research. Any breaches could result in significant repercussions, including the potential revocation of registrations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-asks-medical-colleges-to-vet-draft-rules-seeking-tighter-checks-on-animal-experiments/articleshow/135952093.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/nmc-asks-medical-colleges-to-vet-draft-rules-seeking-tighter-checks-on-animal-experiments/articleshow/135952093.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T12:01:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135952199,imgsize-78013.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Supreme Court issues contempt notice to lawyer over remarks against CJI Surya Kant]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/supreme-court-issues-contempt-notice-to-lawyer-over-remarks-against-cji-surya-kant/articleshow/135951002.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135951002.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/supreme-court-issues-contempt-notice-to-lawyer-over-remarks-against-cji-surya-kant/articleshow/135951002.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/supreme-court-issues-contempt-notice-to-lawyer-over-remarks-against-cji-surya-kant/articleshow/135951002.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-18T11:27:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135951203,imgsize-1092017.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[BJP calls Rahul Gandhi 'Mir Jafar of India' over his remarks on economy in US]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pernicious-pattern-of-tarnishing-indias-image-bjp-fires-back-at-rahul-gandhi-over-us-remarks/articleshow/135950945.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135950945.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Rahul Gandhi's recent remarks at Columbia University regarding India's economy have drawn criticism from BJP leaders. While he mentioned an impending economic disaster and unemployment issues, BJP of